     getIdentifier, CallPip.kt PiP buttons): keep them when release resource
     shrinking runs.
     notifs (2 Nov): c3_person_avatar was stripped from release builds since
     c3-msg (22 Oct) -> getIdentifier()==0 -> IconCompat threw -> EVERY My
     Circle message notification failed silently. CI (android.yml) now fails
     the build if any of these is missing from the APK. -->
<resources xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    tools:keep="@raw/assisto_pop,@raw/assisto_tick,@drawable/ic_stat_assisto,@drawable/c3_person_avatar,@drawable/ic_pip_mic,@drawable/ic_pip_mic_off,@drawable/ic_pip_videocam,@drawable/ic_pip_videocam_off,@drawable/ic_pip_call_end" />
